{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 46, "model_name": "mistralai/mixtral-8x7b-instruct-v0.1", "content": " Upon the distant shore of Japan doth thou desire to set foot, noble traveler? Fear not, for I shall craft a journey most wondrous for thine eyes.\n\nBegin thou in Tokyo, the land's bustling heart, where neon lights doth paint the night sky with their glow. Perchance, take in a show of Kabuki, a dramatic art form most captivating.\n\nThence, venture forth to Nikko, home of the ornate Toshogu Shrine. Here, gaze upon the ornate carvings and gilded facades, a testament to the devotion of the past.\n\nJourney on to Hakone, where the waters of Lake Ashi mirror the heavens above. Take a boat ride, and breathe in the serenity of this place.\n\nThe sacred mountain of Fuji shall be next on thy path. Ascend to its peak, if thou darest, and bask in the glory of its splendor.\n\nIn Kyoto, the ancient capital, explore the winding streets and marvel at the Kinkaku-ji, the Golden Pavilion, a sight so enchanting it doth seem otherworldly.\n\nAt long last, journey to Hiroshima, a city that rose anew from the ashes of war. Pay homage to the Peace Memorial Park, a solemn reminder of the past.\n\nAnd thus, noble traveler, thy itinerary is complete. May this journey bring thee joy and knowledge, and mayst thou return to thine own land with tales to regale for an age.", "logprobs": [{"token": "Upon", "logprob": -0.16018113493919373}, {"token": "the", "logprob": -0.013940464705228806}, {"token": "distant", "logprob": -1.9145479202270508}, {"token": "shore", "logprob": -0.983794629573822}, {"token": "of", "logprob": -2.90866428258596e-05}, {"token": "Japan", "logprob": -0.009249573573470116}, {"token": "d", "logprob": -0.2159704864025116}, {"token": "oth", "logprob": -0.04858732968568802}, {"token": "thou", "logprob": -0.21606183052062988}, {"token": "desire", "logprob": -0.11296375840902328}, {"token": "to", "logprob": -2.3841855067985307e-07}, {"token": "set", "l